{"id":"n60073-2-6","stage":3,"title":"복통 · 冤痛","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60073-2-6-1","ko":"그 사람이 진짜 범인이 아니면 어떻게 하지?","zh":"如果那个人不是真正的犯人怎么办？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진짜","meaning":"真，真的","explanation":"진짜：真，真的","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71538","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"범인이","meaning":"犯人，罪犯","explanation":"범인：犯人，罪犯；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"범인","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14455","senseId":"1","lemma":"범인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아니면","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"아니면","audio":"/audio/8d84741c74792056752a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真，真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71538","definition":"不是赝品或虚构的产物。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"29d23f06ebca35bd","term":"범인","zh":"犯人，罪犯","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3","entryId":"14455","definition":"违反法律、犯了错误的人。","pronunciation":["버ː민"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示想法或推测。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示想法或推测。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a899603ac5b693aa154.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60073-2-6-2","ko":"그럼 정말 복통을 할 일인데.","zh":"那可真是让人痛心又气愤的事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"복통을","meaning":"冤痛，怨","explanation":"복통：冤痛，怨；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"복통","audio":"/audio/9c24b77bba97c3d7c1a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60073","senseId":"2","lemma":"복통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일인데.","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"9c24b77bba97c3d7","term":"복통","zh":"冤痛，怨","audio":"/audio/9c24b77bba97c3d7c1a5.mp3","entryId":"60073","definition":"感到很冤枉很憋闷；或指那种心理。","pronunciation":["복통"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d5172f4bc24ab0904c9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60073","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["如果那个人不是真正的犯人怎么办？","那可真是让人痛心又气愤的事。","我看到你们学校上新闻了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["如果那个人不是真正的犯人怎么办？","那可真是让人痛心又气愤的事。","我看到你们学校上新闻了？"],"answer":1}]}
